      "content": "#include <iostream>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <cstdlib>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n\nstatic inline int read_int() {\n    int x = 0;\n    char c = getchar_unlocked();\n    while (c <= ' ') c = getchar_unlocked();\n    bool neg = false;\n    if (c == '-') { neg = true; c = getchar_unlocked(); }\n    do {\n        x = x * 10 + (c - '0');\n        c = getchar_unlocked();\n    } while (c > ' ');\n    return neg ? -x : x;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n = read_int();\n    int s = read_int();\n\n    long long *pref = nullptr;\n    if (posix_memalign((void**)&pref, 64, sizeof(long long) * (n+1) * (n+1)) != 0) {\n        std::cerr << \"Allocation failed\\n\";\n        return 1;\n    }\n\n    // Initialize first row and column to zero\n    #pragma omp parallel for schedule(static)\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; ++i) {\n        pref[i * (n+1)] = 0;\n        pref[0 * (n+1) + i] = 0;\n    }\n\n    // Read matrix and compute horizontal prefix sums sequentially\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        long long row_sum = 0;\n        int base_i = (i+1) * (n+1);\n        #pragma ivdep\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n            int val = read_int();\n            row_sum += val;\n            pref[base_i + j + 1] = row_sum;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Vertical accumulation pass parallelized over columns\n    #pragma omp parallel for schedule(static)\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n        long long sum = 0;\n        int col_offset = j + 1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n            sum += pref[(i+1) * (n+1) + col_offset];\n            pref[(i+1) * (n+1) + col_offset] = sum;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Search all SxS submatrices\n    long long mxSum = LLONG_MIN;\n    int limit_i = n - s + 1;\n    int limit_j = n - s + 1;\n\n    #pragma omp parallel for collapse(2) reduction(max:mxSum) schedule(static)\n    for (int i = 0; i < limit_i; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < limit_j; ++j) {\n            long long sum = pref[(i+s) * (n+1) + (j+s)]\n                          - pref[i * (n+1) + (j+s)]\n                          - pref[(i+s) * (n+1) + j]\n                          + pref[i * (n+1) + j];\n            if (sum > mxSum) mxSum = sum;\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", static_cast<int>(mxSum));\n\n    free(pref);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "path": "src/solution.cpp"
    }
  ],
  "hypothesis": "Combining fast integer input reading (source A), on-the-fly horizontal prefix sum during sequential input to eliminate matrix storage (A), aligned allocation with posix_memalign for cache-friendly access (B), OpenMP parallelized vertical accumulation over columns (C) and search phase with collapse(2) reduction(max) (C), plus ivdep pragmas from A, yields a correct high-performance solution that outperforms prior integrations on ARM64.",
